# Build context for docker/web.Dockerfile and docker/mcp.Dockerfile (docs/ci-cd.md).
# The images need the pnpm workspace sources and nothing else: keep secrets, history, build output
# and tooling out of the context. Patterns here are anchored at the context root, unlike .gitignore,
# so anything that can appear below a package or an app needs a `**/` prefix. Do not exclude a
# directory that is a pnpm workspace member (see pnpm-workspace.yaml), because
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` needs every member present.
# docker/smoke.sh fails when a file listed here as local-only is found in a built image, and CI
# plants such files (docker/plant-local-files.sh) to prove it.

# Version control, CI and agent tooling
.git
.github
.claude

# Dependencies and build output (the image installs and builds from scratch)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Local configuration and secrets, at the root and in every package and app: CLAUDE.md puts
# per-process secrets in apps/<app>/.env. Only the documented examples are ever tracked.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.mise.local.toml
**/mise.local.toml
**/.auth
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Test output and editor files
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed to build the services
docs
dev
scripts
docker
docker-compose.yml
**/*.md
LICENSE
